factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The draft's reel_script says the competition was held 'in Tiruchengode' and the caption says 'திருச்செங்கோட்டில்' — consistent with the article, so no issue there; however the reel_script states the competition itself was held at the Vidhya Vikaas college, which matches the article.
  The reel_script and slides_spec describe the event as a 'மாநில அளவிலான கணித புதிர் போட்டி மற்றும் பயிற்சி பட்டறை' where 'hundreds of students participated enthusiastically'; the article says hundreds took part in the puzzle competition, not that they participated 'ஆர்வத்துடன' (enthusiastically) — an embellished detail.
  The reel_script says Saranya 'முதலிடம் பிடித்தார்' and the headline says 'மாணவி முதலிடம்', which matches the article's 'முதல் பரிசு', so no issue; however the reel_script says the winners and participants received prizes and certificates, while the article states the prizes and certificates were given by the correspondent-level chairman Singaravel to winners and participants, which matches.
  The caption says 'பொறியியல், மருத்துவம் மற்றும் விண்வெளி ஆராய்ச்சிக்குக் கணிதத்தின் அவசியம் குறித்துத் தாளாளர் சிங்காரவேல் உரையாற்றினார்' — the article describes him saying math's role is important, which is acceptable, but the reel_script and slides_spec describe the mathematics being useful for 'வணிகவியல்' and 'வானியல்' inconsistently across slides (slide says 'பொறியியல், வானியலில்'), which is a mixing of facts not directly supported in the same statement.
  The slides_spec 'முக்கியத்துவம்' slide says 'நிர்வாக இயக்குநர்கள் தலைமையில் விழா நடந்தது' — the article says the four administrative directors presided (தலைமை வகித்தனர) at the opening ceremony, which matches.
  The caption states the date '12 நவம்பர் 2026' as the event day; the article dateline is 'நவ.12' with no year, so the year 2026 is an added detail not in the article (the posting date is excluded from checks, but this is presented as the event date).
