factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 3 problems
  Caption and reel_script state the event was held on 'நவம்பர் 12' (slides_spec 'நவம்பர் 12 செய்தி'): the article gives only 'நவ.12' as the dateline, which is ambiguous and could be read as the event date; the article's date is not clearly the event date, so this is an unsupported date claim.
  reel_script says the competition was a 'மாநில அளவிலான' competition for students and 'இந்தப் போட்டியில் நூற்றுக்கணக்கான மாணவர்கள் பங்கேற்றனர்' is fine, but the article calls the event a workshop held by the maths department; the reel_script opening 'மாநில அளவிலான கணித புதிர் போட்டி நடைபெற்றது' presents the competition itself as held, mixing the workshop and competition into one unclear statement.
  Reel_script says 'வானியல்' research depends on maths alongside engineering, medicine and commerce; the article says engineering, medicine, commerce and astronomy/space research, but the reel_script's phrase 'பொறியியல், வானியல், கணிதத்தை இணைத்து புதிர் போட்ட விதம்' is attributed to Singaravel as praise, which the article supports, so this is acceptable; however the slides_spec line 'பொறியியல், வானியல், கணிதத்தை இணைத்து புதிர்கள்' describes the puzzles as having been combined, a slight alteration of the article's meaning.
