  The article says the Kandha Sashti puja began on Tuesday (செவ்வாய்க்கிழமை), but the draft's reel_script and slides_spec say the puja began on Tuesday as well — consistent; however the article's 6-day puja is said to begin on the Prathamai day after Aippasi Amavasai, and the draft omits this, which is fine. Main issue: the reel_script says 'சூரசம்ஹார நிகழ்ச்சி நடைபெறும்' at Sunday 5 PM in Thiruchengode, matching the article.
  The reel_script states the Panchamirtham and abhishekam items 'இளநீர்' etc. are fine, but the reel_script omits 'வீரபாகுதேவர் தலைமையிலான நவவீரர்களுக்கு' and the article's abhishekam list includes 'விபூதி' and 'மஞ்சள்' which are not mentioned; this is a minor omission rather than an error.
  The draft's caption says 'இளநீர்' and 'பஞ்சாமிர்தம்' among abhishekams, consistent with the article; the reel_script calls the four rathaveethi 'நான்கு ரத வீதிகள்' correctly.
  The reel_script says the puja 'செவ்வாய்க்கிழமை தொடங்கியது' while the article describes it as having begun on Tuesday — consistent, so no factual conflict here.
